{"seq":2,"slug":"pmf-measurement","title":"PMF 量化验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations/pmf-measurement","wordCount":1493,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"pmf-量化验证\">PMF 量化验证</h1><p>&quot;我们达到 Product-Market Fit 了吗？&quot;——这是创业过程中最关键也最难回答的问题。Marc Andreessen 的经典描述&quot;你能感觉到它&quot;过于模糊，实际操作中需要可量化的判定标准。本文提供一套用数据回答这个问题的方法论，覆盖留存曲线、Sean Ellis 测试、以及群组行为分析三个维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-pmf-不是一个时刻而是一个区间\">核心概念：PMF 不是一个时刻而是一个区间</h2><p>Product-Market Fit 不像开关一样&quot;有&quot;或&quot;没有&quot;，而是一个从弱到强的连续谱。量化验证的目标不是给出一个 Yes/No 的二元判定，而是回答&quot;我们在 PMF 光谱上的哪个位置，以及是否在向强 PMF 移动&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Pre-PMF&lt;br/&gt;留存持续下滑] --&gt; B[接近 PMF&lt;br/&gt;留存曲线开始变平]&#10;    B --&gt; C[PMF 达成&lt;br/&gt;留存稳定在健康基线]&#10;    C --&gt; D[强 PMF&lt;br/&gt;自然增长 + NRR &gt; 100%]\">graph LR\n    A[Pre-PMF&lt;br/&gt;留存持续下滑] --&gt; B[接近 PMF&lt;br/&gt;留存曲线开始变平]\n    B --&gt; C[PMF 达成&lt;br/&gt;留存稳定在健康基线]\n    C --&gt; D[强 PMF&lt;br/&gt;自然增长 + NRR &gt; 100%]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PMF 阶段</th>\n<th>留存信号</th>\n<th>Sean Ellis 分数</th>\n<th>群组行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pre-PMF</td>\n<td>D30 &lt; 10%，曲线持续下滑</td>\n<td>&lt; 25%</td>\n<td>无稳定活跃行为模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接近 PMF</td>\n<td>D30 10-20%，曲线开始变平</td>\n<td>25-35%</td>\n<td>出现高留存子群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PMF 达成</td>\n<td>D30 &gt; 20%，曲线水平</td>\n<td>&gt; 40%</td>\n<td>多数用户形成习惯行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强 PMF</td>\n<td>D30 &gt; 35%，曲线上翘</td>\n<td>&gt; 50%</td>\n<td>自然裂变驱动增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"方法一-留存曲线形状分析\">方法一：留存曲线形状分析</h2><p>留存曲线是 PMF 最诚实的信号。它度量的是用户行为的真实结果，不受调查偏差影响。</p>\n<p><strong>判定逻辑：</strong></p>\n<p>留存曲线的关键不是绝对数值，而是<strong>形状</strong>。如果曲线在某个时间点后趋于水平（asymptotic flattening），说明存在一个稳定的核心用户群——这是 PMF 的最基本信号。</p>\n<p><strong>操作方法：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>选定回访事件（必须是核心价值相关行为，不是&quot;打开 App&quot;）</li>\n<li>按周/月群组绘制留存曲线</li>\n<li>计算周期间留存率（period retention）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{period} = \\frac{R_{t}}{R_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3752em;vertical-align:-0.4868em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2025em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4868em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>当周期间留存率稳定在 90% 以上时，曲线已经变平</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>基准参考（2026 年）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>B2B SaaS：月度留存率 88-90% 为中位数，top 四分位 &gt; 92%</li>\n<li>消费类 App：D1 留存 21-25%（均值），Top 10% 达到 35-45%</li>\n<li>D7 留存 10-15%（均值），D30 留存需 &gt; 20% 才视为健康</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"方法二-sean-ellis-非常失望-测试\">方法二：Sean Ellis &quot;非常失望&quot; 测试</h2><p>Sean Ellis 在 2010 年提出的调查方法至今仍是最简洁的 PMF 定性指标。核心问题：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&quot;如果明天不能再使用这个产品，你会有多失望？&quot;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>选项：非常失望 / 有些失望 / 不失望 / 不适用（已经不用了）</p>\n<p><strong>判定标准：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>回答&quot;非常失望&quot;的比例 &gt; 40% → PMF 达成</li>\n<li>25-40% → 接近 PMF，需要优化</li>\n<li>&lt; 25% → 尚未达到 PMF</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实操注意事项：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>样本量至少 40-50 人才有统计意义</li>\n<li>只调查过去 2 周内使用过产品的活跃用户（非活跃用户的回答无信息量）</li>\n<li>追加开放问题：&quot;这个产品给你带来的核心好处是什么？&quot;——用来发现价值主张</li>\n<li>按用户细分切片分析：可能某个子群已达 PMF 而整体未达</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"方法三-群组行为模式分析\">方法三：群组行为模式分析</h2><p>留存曲线告诉你&quot;是否留下来了&quot;，群组行为分析告诉你&quot;留下来的人在做什么&quot;。通过识别高留存群体的共同行为特征，可以找到通向 PMF 的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>操作步骤：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>将用户按留存表现分为高留存组（D30 存活）和低留存组（D30 流失）</li>\n<li>对比两组在前 7 天内的行为差异</li>\n<li>找到区分度最大的行为——即&quot;激活事件&quot;</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>经典案例中的&quot;魔法数字&quot;：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook</strong>：7 天内加 10 个好友的用户留存率显著提升</li>\n<li><strong>Slack</strong>：团队发送 2000 条消息后几乎不再流失</li>\n<li><strong>Twitter</strong>：关注 30 个账号的用户形成内容消费习惯</li>\n<li><strong>Dropbox</strong>：上传第一个文件到同步文件夹</li>\n</ul>\n<p>找到魔法数字后，将其设为激活目标，然后在新手引导中刻意引导用户达成该行为。这实质上是在<strong>制造 PMF</strong>——把少数用户的成功模式推广到所有用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pmf-度量的常见陷阱\">PMF 度量的常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：用收入增长替代 PMF 判定。</strong> 收入可以被补贴驱动——用户为了补贴而来、补贴结束就走。真正的 PMF 信号是无补贴状态下的自然留存。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：样本偏差。</strong> 只调查最活跃的用户（存活者偏差），会高估 PMF 程度。需要同时关注流失用户的流失原因。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：PMF 达成后就不再监测。</strong> 市场在变、竞品在变、用户需求在变。PMF 可以丧失。应该持续追踪群组留存曲线，任何曲线下移都是预警信号。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱四：混淆&quot;产品好&quot;与&quot;渠道好&quot;。</strong> 如果留存数据好但只限于某个特定渠道的用户，可能是渠道筛选了高匹配用户而非产品本身达到了 PMF。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-pmf-判定到行动\">从 PMF 判定到行动</h2><p>PMF 量化的最终目的是指导行动决策：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PMF Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mn>30</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PMF Score} = w_1 \\cdot R_{D30} + w_2 \\cdot S_{Ellis} + w_3 \\cdot B_{activation}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PMF Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mn>30</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{D30}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 D30 留存率（归一化），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{Ellis}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;非常失望&quot;比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{activation}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是完成激活事件的用户比例。三者权重可根据产品类型调整。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PMF Score 高 → 加速获客</strong>：产品已经被验证，现在要把它推给更多人</li>\n<li><strong>PMF Score 中 → 优化激活</strong>：产品有价值但太多人没体验到</li>\n<li><strong>PMF Score 低 → 回到产品迭代</strong>：停止投入获客，聚焦产品改进</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PMF 是连续谱而非二元判定，需要多维度交叉验证</li>\n<li>留存曲线形状（是否变平）是最客观的信号</li>\n<li>Sean Ellis 测试（&gt; 40% &quot;非常失望&quot;）是最简洁的定性指标</li>\n<li>群组行为分析找到&quot;魔法数字&quot;可以制造通向 PMF 的路径</li>\n<li>PMF 会随市场变化而丧失，需要持续监测</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"vanity-vs-actionable-metrics\">虚荣指标与可行动指标</a>——学会区分有信息量的指标和装饰性数字</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../tech-entrepreneurship/product-market-fit/pmf-indicators\">技术创业 · PMF 指标</a>——从创业流程视角看 PMF 验证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PMF 量化验证","id":"pmf-量化验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：PMF 不是一个时刻而是一个区间","id":"核心概念-pmf-不是一个时刻而是一个区间"},{"level":2,"text":"方法一：留存曲线形状分析","id":"方法一-留存曲线形状分析"},{"level":2,"text":"方法二：Sean Ellis \"非常失望\" 测试","id":"方法二-sean-ellis-非常失望-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"方法三：群组行为模式分析","id":"方法三-群组行为模式分析"},{"level":2,"text":"PMF 度量的常见陷阱","id":"pmf-度量的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"从 PMF 判定到行动","id":"从-pmf-判定到行动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"增长指标框架总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations/metrics-framework-overview"},"next":{"title":"虚荣指标与可行动指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations/vanity-vs-actionable-metrics"}}